{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 昨日、ライブを見てくださったみなさん本当にありがとうございました☺︎\n \n \n どうでしたか？\n また感想を教えてください。\n \n \n \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFBY3SBZ8XBB6S3ATJ202","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFD9R225H7D9936CWC59G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFEYS9ZK79K4EYZQW3ZD5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今回はりこをたくさん撮ったよ。\n 皆さんにも少しだけおすそわけします☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFG9A1QFK91EC5C51FSQP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFJ926WNXYXR1ACB1JW5J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 髪型、初期を意識した！って言ってたから初期感出して！って言ったらこのポーズしてた。\n \n たしかにおもてなし会の自己紹介とかこんな感じだったなー。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFKNSD03P5SJ954STCGZA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n りこに写真載せるね！って言ったら #ゆみこかめら 好き！って言ってくれた☺︎にやり\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFN1V3EP3T0DG925E2ZV9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n そんなりこが撮ってくれました☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFPMMVTRQDD20XNKP9ZEY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n それぞれのビーム。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZFR9FEV8DDFKDECZ65BM3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ねえねえ。\n もうずっと言ってるから\n 知ってるかもしれないけど。\n 大好きだよ。本当にいつもありがとう。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"}